PORT12 stage 1: the LP64/little-endian patch of the XGDOS portable modules as far as stage 1 needed it.
Upstream github.com/FrankBRetro/xgdos f6c5aeb7 stays unchanged; apply to a copy, from its root: patch -p0 < lp64-wire.patch.
Build with -DXG_WIRE64. Feasibility only, not complete: measurements/measurement-2026-11-06-port12/RUNINFO.TXT lists what is missing.
