+#ifdef XG_WIRE64
+/* NewTOS LP64 wire (docs/COMPATIBILITY.md): a LONG in a WORD array is low word
+ * first in place; a pointer takes 4 WORDs, native order; pointer n of CONTRL
+ * sits at 7 + n * 4. PORT12 stage 1, feasibility only. */
